==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[MikuDoge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)|Kagamine Rin & Len]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[MikuGory|MikuGories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Hatsune Miku (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

